# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EAS Build archive scope (studio monorepo)
#
# The whole studio shares ONE git repo, and EAS uploads from the repo root.
# Only projects/let-me-check/lmc-app is built, so we exclude everything else.
#
# APPROACH: exclude all sibling projects explicitly, PLUS defensive globs that
# auto-catch the heavy folders (.venv, node_modules, caches) in ANY project —
# including future ones — so a new project can never bloat or break the upload.
#
# (This only controls what the cloud build UPLOADS. It never deletes local files.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Defensive: never upload these heavy/regenerable folders from ANYWHERE in the repo
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.gradle/
**/build/

# Studio-wide, not needed by the app build
/docs/
/skills/
/.github/

# Sibling projects (everything except let-me-check)
/projects/agape/
/projects/pink-pineapple/
/projects/ideas/
/projects/MooMoo Trading Stocks/
/projects/project backups 21st april/

# Let Me Check non-app files (business docs, decks, marketing, images, media)
/projects/let-me-check/docs/
/projects/let-me-check/marketing/
/projects/let-me-check/old-png-images*/
/projects/let-me-check/images/
/projects/let-me-check/*.mp4
/projects/let-me-check/*.mov
/projects/let-me-check/*.mp3
/projects/let-me-check/*.png
/projects/let-me-check/*.pdf

# The app's own regenerable caches (EAS rebuilds these on its servers)
/projects/let-me-check/lmc-app/ios/
/projects/let-me-check/lmc-app/android/
/projects/let-me-check/lmc-app/.expo/
/projects/let-me-check/lmc-app/_archive/
/projects/let-me-check/lmc-app/*.bak

# Repo tooling / junk that never belongs in a build
/.claude-flow/
/.claude/
/.swarm/
/.mcp.json
/ruvector.db
SECURITY_*.json
*.log
.DS_Store
